{"title":"P4961 - P4961 小埋与扫雷 - 洛谷","slug":"2026-05-27-P4961-P4961-小埋与扫雷-洛谷","date":"2026-05-26T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-05-27T09:46:25.425Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2026-05-27-P4961-P4961-小埋与扫雷-洛谷.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"算法名称：小埋与扫雷\"><a href=\"#算法名称：小埋与扫雷\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法名称：小埋与扫雷\"></a>算法名称：小埋与扫雷</h2><h3 id=\"核心优化技巧\"><a href=\"#核心优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心优化技巧\"></a>核心优化技巧</h3><p>在解决“小埋与扫雷”问题时，我们主要关注两个部分：动态规划和空间优化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"1-动态规划\"><a href=\"#1-动态规划\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 动态规划\"></a>1. 动态规划</h4><p>动态规划是解决这类问题的关键。通过将问题分解为更小的子问题，并存储这些子问题的解，我们可以避免重复计算，从而大大减少时间复杂度。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>问题分析</strong>: 这个问题可以看作是一个网格问题，我们需要找出所有可能的空位（即0），同时避免选择已经填好的区域（即1）。</li>\n<li><strong>算法原理</strong>: 对于每个位置，我们有两种选择：要么选择这个位置，要么不选择。如果我们选择这个位置，那么这个位置周围的8个相邻位置中，有且仅有一个位置是空的。因此，我们只需要考虑这8个相邻位置即可。</li>\n<li><strong>数学推导</strong>: 设<code>grid[i][j]</code>表示网格中第<code>i</code>行第<code>j</code>列的位置，如果<code>grid[i][j] == 0</code>，则<code>grid[i-1][j]</code>, <code>grid[i+1][j]</code>, <code>grid[i][j-1]</code>, <code>grid[i][j+1]</code>中必有一个是空的。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"2-空间优化\"><a href=\"#2-空间优化\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 空间优化\"></a>2. 空间优化</h4><p>由于动态规划需要存储大量的中间结果，因此空间优化尤为重要。我们可以通过以下方式进行优化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>原地修改</strong>: 在处理过程中，尽量避免创建新的数组或列表，而是直接在原有数组上进行操作。</li>\n<li><strong>剪枝</strong>: 对于已经被填充的区域，我们可以提前剪枝，避免后续的重复计算。</li>\n<li><strong>并行计算</strong>: 对于大网格，可以考虑使用并行计算来加速计算过程。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"代码详解\"><a href=\"#代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码详解\"></a>代码详解</h3><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">find_empty_positions</span>(<span class=\"params\">grid</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    m, n = <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(grid), <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(grid[<span class=\"number\">0</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    visited = [[<span class=\"literal\">False</span>] * n <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(m)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    empty_blocks = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(m):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(n):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> grid[i][j] == <span class=\"number\">0</span> <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> visited[i][j]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                visited[i][j] = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                stack = [(i, j)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> stack:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    x, y = stack.pop()</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> dx, dy <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> [(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">0</span>), (-<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">0</span>), (<span class=\"number\">0</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>), (<span class=\"number\">0</span>, -<span class=\"number\">1</span>)]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                        nx, ny = x + dx, y + dy</span><br><span class=\"line\">                        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"number\">0</span> &lt;= nx &lt; m <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"number\">0</span> &lt;= ny &lt; n <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> visited[nx][ny]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                            visited[nx][ny] = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                                stack.append((nx, ny))</span><br><span class=\"line\">                                empty_blocks += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    special_digits = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(m):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(n):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> grid[i][j] == <span class=\"number\">1</span> <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> visited[i][j]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                has_space_neighbor = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> dx, dy <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> [(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">0</span>), (-<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">0</span>), (<span class=\"number\">0</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>), (<span class=\"number\">0</span>, -<span class=\"number\">1</span>)]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    ni, nj = i + dx, j + dy</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"number\">0</span> &lt;= ni &lt; m <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"number\">0</span> &lt;= nj &lt; n <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> is_space[ni][nj]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                        has_space_neighbor = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                        <span class=\"keyword\">break</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> has_space_neighbor:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    special_digits += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    ans = empty_blocks + special_digits</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(ans)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"复杂度分析\"></a>复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: O(mn)，其中m和n分别是网格的行数和列数。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: O(mn)，主要用于存储访问过的单元格和空位。</li>\n<li><strong>复杂度对比</strong>: 相比于其他解法，本解法在时间复杂度上具有优势，但在空间复杂度上相对较高。</li>\n</ul>\n","more":"<h2 id=\"算法名称：小埋与扫雷\"><a href=\"#算法名称：小埋与扫雷\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法名称：小埋与扫雷\"></a>算法名称：小埋与扫雷</h2><h3 id=\"核心优化技巧\"><a href=\"#核心优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心优化