), (<span class=\"number\">0</span>, -<span class=\"number\">1</span>)]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    ni, nj = i + dx, j + dy</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"number\">0</span> &lt;= ni &lt; m <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"number\">0</span> &lt;= nj &lt; n <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> is_space[ni][nj]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                        has_space_neighbor = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                        <span class=\"keyword\">break</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> has_space_neighbor:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    special_digits += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    ans = empty_blocks + special_digits</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(ans)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"复杂度分析\"></a>复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: O(mn)，其中m和n分别是网格的行数和列数。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: O(mn)，主要用于存储访问过的单元格和空位。</li>\n<li><strong>复杂度对比</strong>: 相比于其他解法，本解法在时间复杂度上具有优势，但在空间复杂度上相对较高。</li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"P4961","path":"api/tags/P4961.json"}]}